OL,3,GNEWSAPolice slow to respond to Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, says council boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police is yet to comment, but
OL,7,Fcabinet minister Jonathan Reynolds said
OL,8,Fofficers "did deal with it swiftly".
